Your turn. Say: Innovation vs. ethics.

65
00:04:07.333 --> 00:04:09.217
Innovation vs. ethics.

66
00:04:10.033 --> 00:04:13.313
Part two: dialogue. Let's listen to a conversation.

67
00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:16.428
Visal, is AI good or bad?

68
00:04:17.517 --> 00:04:23.141
Both. While AI brings innovation, it also raises ethical concerns.

69
00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:25.460
What worries you?

70
00:04:26.550 --> 00:04:32.465
Algorithmic bias. Whereas humans can explain choices, some AI cannot.

71
00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:34.946
So what is the answer?

72
00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:41.466
Human oversight. While machines are fast, people must check the results.

73
00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:44.019
Part three: grammar.

74
00:04:44.883 --> 00:04:48.520
Grammar focus: Concession clauses (while and whereas).

75
00:04:48.820 --> 00:04:49.972
Look at the pattern.

76
00:04:50.683 --> 00:04:55.109
While AI brings innovation, it also raises ethical concerns.

77
00:04:56.017 --> 00:04:59.305
Whereas humans can explain choices, some AI cannot.

78
00:05:00.217 --> 00:05:02.959
While apps are free, they often collect our data.

79
00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:09.083
'While' and 'whereas' show contrast inside one sentence. Don't add 'but' to the same sentence.

80
00:05:09.817 --> 00:05:14.849
Be careful! Don't say: While AI brings innovation, but it raises concerns.

81
00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:20.738
Say: While AI brings innovation, it raises concerns.

82
00:05:21.038 --> 00:05:22.748
Don't use 'but' with 'while'.

83
00:05:23.533 --> 00:05:26.255
Part four: reading. Read and listen.

84
00:05:27.067 --> 00:05:28.532
Right and Wrong in Tech.

85
00:05:28.832 --> 00:05:31.377
Technology changes our lives every day.

86
00:05:32.367 --> 00:05:36.386
While AI brings innovation, it also raises ethical concerns.

87
00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:40.514
Algorithmic bias and surveillance concerns are growing.

88
00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:47.168
Whereas some companies practise ethical design, others ignore data privacy rights.

89
00:05:48.167 --> 00:05:51.432
Human oversight and transparency in tech are essential.

90
00:05:52.533 --> 00:05:56.314
Part five: quiz. Three questions. Are you ready?

91
00:05:57.150 --> 00:05:59.904
blank AI is useful, it has risks.

92
00:06:00.204 --> 00:06:03.765
A, While. B, But. C, So.

93
00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:09.044
The answer is A: While.

94
00:06:10.183 --> 00:06:14.087
Unfair results from computer programs are algorithmic blank.

95
00:06:14.387 --> 00:06:18.052
A, bias. B, consent. C, design.

96
00:06:21.600 --> 00:06:23.414
The answer is A: bias.

97
00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:27.966
People checking what machines do is human blank.

98
00:06:28.266 --> 00:06:32.012
A, oversight. B, rights. C, impact.

99
00:06:35.567 --> 00:06:37.473
The answer is A: oversight.

100
00:06:38.667 --> 00:06:41.540
Part six: speaking. It's your turn to talk.

101
00:06:42.383 --> 00:06:45.614
What ethical concerns do you have about new technology?

102
00:06:54.417 --> 00:06:55.812
Now listen to Visal.

103
00:06:56.112 --> 00:07:05.708
I worry about privacy. While apps make life easier, they often collect our data without clear consent, so we need stronger rules.

104
00:07:06.008 --> 00:07:07.810
Excellent answer, Visal!

105
00:07:08.717 --> 00:07:13.668
Great work! Now you can use twelve new words and concession clauses (while and whereas).

106
00:07:13.968 --> 00:07:18.118
Today's value is responsibility. Help at home and do your jobs.

107
00:07:18.418 --> 00:07:21.117
